WEBVTT

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:10.740
This whole school was prepared just for you.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.620
<i>Just for me?</i>

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.970
<i>Is that possible?</i>

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.590
Shouta-san?

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.240
Sorry. Did I wake you?

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.270
Um... Uh...

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.910
My turn as your roommate 
is almost over, so...

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.220
Shouta-san?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.880
Sorry. I'm not in the mood today.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:47.060
No, I'm the one who's sorry.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.800
Where you going?

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.560
I just wanted some fresh air.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:59.950
That's allowed, isn't it?

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.950
You're not allowed to leave the grounds.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.080
Am I going to live here forever?

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:11.610
You're more precious than 
anything else in this world.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.150
So that might be a good idea!

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.020
No!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.390
I'm kidding!

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:18.160
Don't make that face.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:21.220
You can leave when you graduate.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.780
Now, let's head back to your room.

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:27.480
Have a fun night with Ichijou-san.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:30.000
You'll be getting a new 
roommate soon, after all.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.980
Goodnight!

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.700
Okay, everybody, listen up!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.010
Take turns drawing from the box!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.960
<b>Box of Fun</b>

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:13.670
The winner gets to be 
Shouta-sama's next roommate.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.540
It'll be me next...

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:20.170
Behold my incredible luck.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.140
I'll go first.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.020
Go ahead.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.050
The winning one has a circle on it.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.560
This!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:29.340
Too bad!

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.430
Okay, my turn.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.370
Too bad!

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:37.700
Aww!

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.880
I wish I could draw...

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:46.160
<i>I can't believe I'm being 
treated like a prize.</i>

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.250
<i>It's weird!</i>

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:48.450
I win!

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.080
I'm next!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.990
Congratulations!

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:55.210
Doi-chan, let's have some fun!

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:57.010
<i>That's...</i>

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.460
<i>I'm not good around girls who act like her.</i>

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.720
Hey there.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.600
Wai— Wh-What?!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.730
I didn't want to wait until night.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.730
Let's do it here.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.110
What are you—

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.610
Hey, hurry it up, Dojii.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.490
Seriously? That's creepy.

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:26.540
Come on, let's have some fun, Doi-chan.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.740
I heard the news, Doi-chan.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.750
S-Stop it!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:34.250
Why?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.600
Doi-chan, wait!

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.630
Oh, dear.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:41.520
But I'm sure he's been through 
enough that he'll be fine.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:45.800
<b>Teacher's Office</b>

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:51.660
<i>I haven't been here since 
I woke up from cold sleep.</i>

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:56.750
<i>It feels like it all happened so long ago,</i>

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:00.070
<i>even though for me it 
wasn't that long at all.</i>

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.240
<i>I always hid here when things got difficult.</i>

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.470
That's...

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:12.080
Doi-chin? Why?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.460
Shunka-chan, what are you doing here?

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.080
Well...

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.960
Doi-chin, sit down.

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.060
Okay.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:28.510
Hey, that poster...

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.970
Did you put that up?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.080
So this was your spot, huh?

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:35.700
That makes me happy.

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:39.980
Doi-chin, what I saw...

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.860
at the pool...

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.100
Yeah. That's right.

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.410
I was bullied.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.660
Pretty hard, too.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:56.190
A person I thought was my friend 
pretended he saw nothing.

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:05.090
By the way, Shunka-chan...

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.350
Is that...?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.950
I was bullied in middle school, too.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.350
I've made friends since coming here, though!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.110
But sometimes I remember that past, 
and it hurts to be around other people.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:29.640
Then I come here and just sit, 
or listen to music.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:32.120
And I can forget the bad things.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.680
I know what you mean.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:35.220
I was the same way.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.270
We're the same, huh?

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.260
Hey...

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.070
Doi-chin, show me your bruises.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.590
Touch them...

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.800
Doi-chin!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.510
That's my...

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.610
It's a magic spell to make you feel better!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.780
More... give me more...

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.800
More spells for the rest of my body...

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:32.980
Doi-chan!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.690
Is this really okay?

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.810
It's fine.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:41.800
You're...

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.150
Doi-chan.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.900
Who is that?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.830
Hiiragi-san, from our class.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.460
I know that!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.400
I mean, what's she doing here?!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.910
By the way, Doi-chan, do you know my name?

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:55.690
Um...

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.660
I knew it! You don't!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.010
Rikka! Yanagi Rikka!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.770
Remember my name!

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:02.790
S-Sorry.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:09.420
And remember that it's 
my turn this week, too.

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:13.160
In the end, it's Shou-chin's decision.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.390
What?! Then why have a lottery?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:18.990
You ran from me at school, too.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:20.640
Do you not want me?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.640
It hurts me.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.900
Um, well...

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.150
You two are already doing it, huh?

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.530
Um...

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:37.160
Then it wouldn't kill you to 
do it with me once, would it?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:40.130
Don't be vulgar around my Shou-chin!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.160
He's not <i>yours</i>!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.820
And who was the one that broke 
the rules and screwed him first?

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:49.110
There's love and caring 
between the two of us!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.420
Not rules!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:53.150
When did you two develop that kind of love?

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:55.440
I love him a ton, too, okay?

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:59.190
You just won the lottery is all!

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.590
Winning the lottery means it's fate—

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:02.530
I'll go take a walk!

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:03.810
Wait, Doi-chan!

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:03.810
Doi-chin!

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:10.270
<i>I never thought they'd fight over me.</i>

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:13.030
<i>I wish I could see Sensei...</i>

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.190
She's not picking up.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:25.790
Is she avoiding me because she doesn't 
like me sleeping with other girls?

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.670
But what am I supposed to do?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.130
Doi-san?

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.320
Toudou-san?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:35.700
H-Hello there.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:42.680
I-Is it fun, having Yanagi-san as a roommate?

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:47.440
Being a roommate with a person you've 
barely ever talked to is just exhausting.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.880
I see.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:02.450
Oh, is your forehead okay?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:08.850
It hurts a little at night, actually.

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:14.590
The bruise is gone, but it hurts inside...

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.590
I'm really sorry!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:18.840
I'll do anything!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:22.220
None of them dislike you.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:26.020
Then, roll up your shirt.

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:29.180
Sorry, I was kidding—

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:34.270
Will this do?

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.280
So soft...

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.060
Like marshmallows...

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:46.660
Sorry! I don't know what I'm doing—

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:47.810
No...

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.950
Goodnight!

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:58.420
<i>I was so awful yesterday.</i>

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.430
Doi-san?

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.620
Wh-What's wrong!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:08.930
Um...

00:11:10.360 --> 00:11:12.000
I'm sorry about last night.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.320
What are you talking about?

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:22.700
You were worried about me... 
and I took advantage of you.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:29.830
Then, can you make it up to me by 
helping me clean up the gym equipment?

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:31.960
O-Of course.

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:35.780
So where do we...

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.710
Toudou-san, why are you—

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.810
Toudou-san!

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:53.010
I'm sorry for being rough,

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.940
but I can't wait anymore!

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.570
Wait!

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:07.280
What's gotten into you, Toudou-san?

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.200
It's your fault!

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:14.330
I've been waiting... Waiting for so long!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.960
W-Wait!

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:28.900
After it was over, 
Toudou-san apologized to me again and again.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:34.070
<i>I just felt awkward. I didn't mind.</i>

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:38.980
<i>Yanagi-san temporarily 
stopped being my roommate.</i>

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.130
<i>She argued with Karen-chan a lot, but...</i>

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:46.370
<i>I don't feel up to mating with her today.</i>

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:50.990
<i>I said I was tired, 
and she was asked to leave.</i>

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.340
<i>And I slept alone for the first time in ages.</i>

00:12:58.280 --> 00:12:59.380
Assigned to me?

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.880
That's right!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:06.260
Every day you're going to have a 
girl from class assigned to you!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.010
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:06.010
<b>Assigned to Me</b>

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.890
First is Yanagi-san!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:10.890
Really? Me?

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.640
I made you quit being his roommate,

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.860
so you get to be first.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:17.900
Aww, you're so nice, Kamiya-cchi!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.900
W-Wait, what is this?

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:25.990
They'll be the person who takes 
care of you here at school!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.660
There'll be times when I can't be with you.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:34.500
Your roommate is there for a week, 
so I want to increase turnover rate.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:39.560
I want you to be closer to 
the girls at school!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:40.880
I know that, but...

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:42.000
Oh, right!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:47.260
Give your assigned girl a good 
morning kiss each day, okay?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:49.000
A kiss? Why?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:53.010
As a reward for taking care of you!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.390
Doi-chan! Doi-chan!

00:13:54.800 --> 00:13:56.270
Give me my reward!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.110
That's weird!

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:01.270
Sorry, you're still embarrassed, right?

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:04.150
Everybody, turn around!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.880
Doi-chan... just a kiss, okay?

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:21.080
I thought you didn't like 
me... so I'm happy...

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.560
One more time?

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:27.000
Girls can feel pretty 
good just from a kiss...

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.220
I-I'm sorry, wait... 
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:33.380
Shouta-sama!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:35.220
I'm so embarrassed.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.850
I just scraped it a little.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.280
Karen-chan?

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.610
Shouta-sama, let's go to the nurse's office.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.280
You're making too big a 
deal out of this stuff.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:43.860
It's nothing.

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.030
No!

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:47.860
You're humanity's treasure!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.360
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:51.920
Okay, you're all set.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.370
Thank you.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:56.490
I hope we can get rid of 
those old bruises, too.

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.500
No... it's fine.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.930
I'll give you a full body 
scan, just to be safe.

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:03.200
Could you lie down?

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.000
Full body?

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:08.130
I just scraped my hand...

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:11.900
Humanity is finished if 
something happens to you.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.390
Of course we're careful.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.640
Is that true?

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:19.230
Oh, you don't believe it, do you?

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.520
<i>I'm so horny, I can't focus on anything...</i>

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.600
Okay, you're set.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:30.030
This bed's really big.

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:32.280
Do you know why?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.870
Shouta-sama! Are you okay?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.660
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:42.670
But part of you still needs attention, right?

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.130
Ta-da!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.610
These three are here to 
make you feel all better!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.020
But my scrape's already gone...

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.660
Aww, don't worry about it.

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.300
It should be Yanagi-san, 
your assigned girl, who does it, but...

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.700
But it's still her first day.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:03.060
So we'll use the three who are 
already your close friends!

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.840
Okay, girls!

00:16:04.840 --> 00:16:11.240
Take care of Shouta-sama, for the sake of 
the whole class, no, every woman on Earth!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:12.070
Karen-chan!

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:13.950
Are you okay?

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:15.320
Yeah.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:18.950
How can we cure your injuries?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.460
I know how...

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:29.140
Do this to them.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.760
Doi-san!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.470
Doi-san!

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.480
This is harder than it looks.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:50.860
It hasn't even been a month since Shouta-sama 
lost his virginity, so he's doing well.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:55.360
Three girls at once! Like a king!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.370
He's starting to get used to girls...

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:01.650
I think it's time for us 
to move to the next stage.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:07.020
Don't you think so, Hoshino-san?

00:17:13.560 --> 00:17:15.990
<i>Class is over...</i>

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.010
<b>Science Room</b>

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.760
It's done!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:24.770
If he drinks this, he'll fall 
in love with my charms!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.620
What kind of experiment are you doing?

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.170
It's rude to come in without asking!

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:33.030
Sorry! I heard a voice, so...

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:37.450
Are you okay after your fall?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.660
Y-Yeah.

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:44.540
Kamiya's such a stupid girl. It would 
be so much better to have me treat you.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:48.920
Oh, you don't have an assigned 
roommate this week, do you?

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.930
Want to pick me?

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.070
Act now and I'll say yes!

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.470
I'm really wondering...

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.180
What is it about me you like?

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.180
Your face.

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:00.980
Face?

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:06.940
What? Did you have intercourse with too many 
stupid women and it damaged your brain?

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.320
Face?

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.640
You've got such weird tastes.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.820
And aren't there other ways of saying that?

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.800
And, um...

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.500
You don't seem stupid.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:20.560
And you're caring enough to look out 
for the idiot girls in our class...

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:22.330
That's kind of nice...

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.330
Chifuyu-chan?

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.390
Am I not good enough?

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.990
Given my family's average bust size,

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:32.840
mine will eventually grow pretty big!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:42.000
Thank you.

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:45.100
Hearing you say that about 
me gives me confidence.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.790
Really? I know, right?

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.440
You finally realized how great I am, huh?

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:51.620
Now, let's get to mating...

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.980
When you grow up a little more, okay?

00:18:55.980 --> 00:19:00.360
Fool! There is no girl more 
psychologically mature than me!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:05.240
Fine! I'll ask my sister who lives in the 
Core to let me use one of the growth machines!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.240
Chifuyu-chan?

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:10.450
When I'm grown up and you fall in 
love with me, it'll be too late!

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.060
She sure is energetic...

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.380
Huh? Karen-chan!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.380
I've got a message about Yuzu-sensei!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:25.140
She's transferring schools 
for family reasons!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.770
Transferring?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:29.580
Transferring! Yes!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.440
She's no longer in Keimon City!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:33.520
I can't tell you why!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:35.050
This is so sudden...

00:19:35.050 --> 00:19:36.380
That's not fair!

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:37.780
She didn't say anything...

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:41.030
But the decision's already been made.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:44.140
Bring her back...

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:48.040
I don't think she'll be back for a while.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.040
How long is a while?

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:55.040
Hm... A year or two?

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:58.920
Weren't you going to surround 
me with people I liked?!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.240
You'll see her again someday.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.530
<i>I want to see her now...</i>

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.940
<i>In the end, I'm just a bird in a cage...</i>

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.730
What will you do for tonight?

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.500
Want me to bring Hiiragi-san or somebody?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.980
I'll sleep alone.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.590
<i>I really loved Yuzu-sensei...</i>

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:38.860
<i>But maybe she...</i>

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:43.910
She's your assigned girl for the day!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.390
G-Good morning...

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.140
You remember about the kiss, right?

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.910
<i>I can have any of them...</i>

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:17.170
<i>When I think about it, it's pretty amazing...</i>

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.920
<i>I could have her...</i>

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.920
<i>She's cute, too.</i>

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:22.920
<i>They're all cute.</i>

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:27.550
Hey, about tonight...

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:39.570
<i>Maybe being in this crazy school 
was driving me crazy.</i>

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:51.280
Everybody, I have a transfer 
student to introduce to you!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.540
<i>A transfer student? At this time of year?</i>

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.850
I'm... Hoshino... Shion.

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:02.670
Nice to meet you all.

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Revenge</b>
